---
// Architecture areas, as a ruled panel with icons.
---
<section class="section wrap" id="architecture">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="kicker">Architecture Areas</p>
    <h2>Architecture &amp; Engineering</h2>
    <p class="sub">I focus on designing backend systems that are scalable, maintainable and resilient while remaining aligned with business workflows.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="arch">
    <article class="arch-area">
      <span class="arch-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Service Architecture</h3>
      <ul><li>Microservices and modular backend architecture</li><li>Service boundaries based on business capabilities</li><li>API-first design</li><li>Separation of business, integration and persistence concerns</li></ul>
    </article>
    <article class="arch-area">
      <span class="arch-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="2.5"/><circle cx="19" cy="5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2.5"/><path d="M7.3 11 16.7 6M7.3 13l9.4 5"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Distributed Processing</h3>
      <ul><li>Asynchronous processing</li><li>Event-driven architecture</li><li>Message queues and service buses</li><li>Retry and failure handling</li><li>Idempotent processing</li></ul>
    </article>
    <article class="arch-area">
      <span class="arch-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5.5" rx="7.5" ry="2.8"/><path d="M4.5 5.5v13c0 1.5 3.4 2.8 7.5 2.8s7.5-1.3 7.5-2.8v-13M4.5 12c0 1.5 3.4 2.8 7.5 2.8s7.5-1.3 7.5-2.8"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Data Architecture</h3>
      <ul><li>Relational and NoSQL data modelling</li><li>Transaction management</li><li>Query optimisation</li><li>Database performance tuning</li></ul>
    </article>
    <article class="arch-area">
      <span class="arch-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 8h14m-4-4 4 4-4 4M20 16H6m4-4-4 4 4 4"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Integration Architecture</h3>
      <ul><li>REST APIs</li><li>Third-party integrations</li><li>Data transformation and validation</li><li>Retry and reconciliation mechanisms</li></ul>
    </article>
    <article class="arch-area">
      <span class="arch-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.3-5.6M20 4v5h-5"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Resilience</h3>
      <ul><li>Timeout management</li><li>Retry strategies</li><li>Circuit breakers</li><li>Graceful degradation</li><li>Error handling</li></ul>
    </article>
    <article class="arch-area">
      <span class="arch-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4.5" y="10.5" width="15" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10.5V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3.5M12 14.5v2.5"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Security</h3>
      <ul><li>Authentication and authorization</li><li>API security</li><li>Vulnerability remediation</li><li>Secure integration patterns</li><li>Data protection considerations</li></ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
